  },
  "stages": [
    {
      "key": "attention",
      "title": "Attention",
      "question": "are the right people finding us?",
      "intro": ["PostHog records these itself. No custom events."],
      "notes": [
        "Search Console and PageSpeed data are pulled into the internal app separately."
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "intent",
      "title": "Intent",
      "question": "what are they interested in?",
      "intro": [],
      "notes": [
        "`cta_id` must be stable. Reports track it month on month, so a CTA whose wording changes keeps its id. A CTA that now does something different gets a new one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "action",
      "title": "Action",
      "question": "did they act?",
      "intro": [],
      "notes": [
        "`form_submitted` gives the funnel and the channel, because it shares a session with the page views. `lead_submitted` is the number reported to the client, because an ad blocker cannot remove it. Expect `form_submitted` to be a little lower. If it is *much* lower, that points to ad blocking or a broken client event, so investigate.",
        "Never put field values, the message, or anything the visitor typed into any property."
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "consent",
      "title": "Consent",
      "question": "who can we measure beyond the baseline?",
      "intro": [
        "Only on sites with a consent banner, which means sites running paid advertising or replay under the skill's `references/advertising.md`. A site with no banner never sends it, and its absence there is not drift."
      ],
      "notes": [
        "It is sent through the cookieless baseline, as a count of how a banner is answered, which is a statistic about the site. Together with `ad_consent` it gives every report the coverage figure that consent-based data must state."
      ],
      "dashboardNote": "Sites with a banner only."
    },
    {
      "key": "revenue",
      "title": "Revenue",
      "question": "did it make money?",
      "intro": [
        "Server side only, sent from the CRM integration or entered through the internal app once the client reports outcomes. Not every client will have these at first, and reports say so rather than leaving the stage out."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "dashboardNote": "Once they exist."
    },
    {
      "key": "intelligence",
      "title": "Intelligence",
      "question": "what did we learn?",
      "intro": [
        "Not events. The learning log in the internal app records what changed on the site and when (a new proposition, a redesigned form, a campaign launch) so reports can connect a change to what followed."
      ],
      "notes": []
    }
  ],
  "posthogEvents": [
    {
      "name": "$pageview",
      "source": "posthog-js",
      "carries": "URL, referrer, UTM parameters, device, country"
    },
    {
      "name": "$pageleave",
      "source": "posthog-js",
      "carries": "Time on page and scroll"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "name": "cta_clicked",
      "since": 1,
      "stage": "intent",
      "origin": "browser",
      "firedWhen": "A click on any element with `data-cta`",
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "cta_id",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "doc": "stable slug, e.g. `hero-book-call`"
        },
        {
          "name": "cta_text",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "cta_location",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": false,
          "doc": "section slug, e.g. `hero`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "contact_link_clicked",
      "since": 1,
      "stage": "intent",
      "origin": "browser",
      "firedWhen": "A click on a `tel:`, `mailto:` or WhatsApp link",
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "channel",
          "since": 1,
          "type": {
            "enum": ["phone", "email", "whatsapp"]
          },
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "cta_location",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "file_downloaded",
      "since": 1,
      "stage": "intent",
      "origin": "browser",
      "firedWhen": "A click on a link with `download`, or to a PDF, DOC(X), XLS(X), PPT(X), ZIP or CSV",
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "file_name",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "file_type",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "outbound_link_clicked",
      "since": 1,
      "stage": "intent",
      "origin": "browser",
      "firedWhen": "A click on a link to another hostname",
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "link_domain",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "doc": "hostname only, never the full URL"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "scroll_depth_reached",
      "since": 1,
      "stage": "intent",
      "origin": "browser",
      "firedWhen": "The page first passes 25, 50, 75 or 100% scrolled",
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "depth_percent",
          "since": 1,
          "type": {
            "enum": [25, 50, 75, 100]
          },
          "required": true,
          "doc": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "video_played",
      "since": 1,
      "stage": "intent",
      "origin": "browser",
      "firedWhen": "A video starts, once per video per page",
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "video_id",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "form_started",
      "since": 1,
      "stage": "action",
      "origin": "browser",
      "firedWhen": "First focus inside a `form[data-form-id]`, once per page",
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "form_id",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "form_error_shown",
      "since": 1,
      "stage": "action",
      "origin": "browser",
      "firedWhen": "A field fails validation and the error is shown",
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "form_id",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "field_name",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "error_type",
          "since": 1,
          "type": {
            "enum": ["required", "format", "too_long", "server"]
          },
          "required": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "form_abandoned",
      "since": 1,
      "stage": "action",
      "origin": "browser",
      "firedWhen": "The visitor leaves the page after `form_started` without submitting",
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "form_id",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "last_field",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "nullable": true,
          "required": true,
          "doc": "field **name**"
        },
        {
          "name": "fields_completed",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "integer",
          "required": true,
          "doc": "count"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "form_submitted",
      "since": 1,
      "stage": "action",
      "origin": "browser",
      "firedWhen": "The site's form code confirms a successful submission",
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "form_id",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "lead_submitted",
      "since": 1,
      "stage": "action",
      "origin": "server",
      "firedWhen": "**Server.** The enquiry was delivered",
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "form_id",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "lead_type",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "doc": "site-defined slug, e.g. `general`, `quote`, `partnership`"
        },
        {
          "name": "channel",
          "since": 3,
          "type": {
            "enum": [
              "direct",
              "organic_search",
              "paid_search",
              "organic_social",
              "paid_social",
              "email",
              "ai",
              "referral",
              "other_paid",
              "unknown"
            ]
          },
          "required": false,
          "doc": "from the tab's landing attribution, classified by the package; `unknown` when it could not tell. The server capture always sends it on `lead_submitted`"
        },
        {
          "name": "utm_source",
          "since": 3,
          "type": "string",
          "required": false,
          "doc": "parsed on the server; never a value containing `@` or a long run of digits"
        },
        {
          "name": "utm_medium",
          "since": 3,
          "type": "string",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "name": "utm_campaign",
          "since": 3,
          "type": "string",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "name": "referring_domain",
          "since": 3,
          "type": "string",
          "required": false,
          "doc": "hostname only"
        },
        {
          "name": "heard_about",
          "since": 3,
          "type": {
            "enum": [
              "search_engine",
              "social_media",
              "recommendation",
              "directory",
              "press",
              "event",
              "returning_client",
              "other"
            ]
          },
          "required": false,
          "doc": "the visitor's own answer, where a site asks; each site maps its wording onto this list"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "consent_updated",
      "since": 2,
      "stage": "consent",
      "origin": "browser",
      "firedWhen": "The visitor makes an explicit choice in the banner or the settings control. Not sent on page loads that only read a stored choice",
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "advertising",
          "since": 2,
          "type": "boolean",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "recordings",
          "since": 2,
          "type": "boolean",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "source",
          "since": 2,
          "type": {
            "enum": ["banner", "settings"]
          },
          "required": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "lead_qualified",
      "since": 1,
      "stage": "revenue",
      "origin": "server",
      "firedWhen": "The client confirms a lead was a real opportunity",
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "lead_type",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "form_id",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "channel",
          "since": 3,
          "type": {
            "enum": [
              "direct",
              "organic_search",
              "paid_search",
              "organic_social",
              "paid_social",
              "email",
              "ai",
              "referral",
              "other_paid",
              "unknown"
            ]
          },
          "required": false,
          "doc": "carried from the lead, where the site stored it"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "deal_won",
      "since": 1,
      "stage": "revenue",
      "origin": "server",
      "firedWhen": "A lead became paid work",
      "properties": [
        {
          "name": "lead_type",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "name": "value",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "integer",
          "required": true,
          "doc": "number, whole units"
        },
        {
          "name": "currency",
          "since": 1,
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "doc": "ISO 4217"
        },
        {
          "name": "channel",
          "since": 3,
          "type": {
            "enum": [
              "direct",
              "organic_search",
              "paid_search",
              "organic_social",
              "paid_social",
              "email",
              "ai",
              "referral",
              "other_paid",
              "unknown"
            ]
          },
          "required": false,
          "doc": "carried from the lead, where the site stored it"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
